{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the sum of the prime factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054090e60a5dcb8bc33213620b3af9278f9a3e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5dfe5935444be180eb2534d500f7bc6c88bee22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 67\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 75\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 77\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 201\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we must find the prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054090e60a5dcb8bc33213620b3af9278f9a3e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d801dd3ca9fa46d4982b4536aa5e4301d8cd3234.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010=2\\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 67$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"145\" height=\"13\" />. We add the factors up to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2833e4df99f8ba7f8b0caf602cf08f8ca40297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 77}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6xNkyDgIhEE?t=1236\">https://youtu.be/6xNkyDgIhEE?t=1236</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks\">Video by MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hRHZxSieKc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hRHZxSieKc</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8\">2010 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Pr